{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16162","headline":"寄贺田侍中东平功成 · 王建","name":"寄贺田侍中东平功成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使回高品满城传，亲见沂公在阵前。\n百里旗幡冲即断，两重衣甲射皆穿。\n探知点检兵应怯，算得新移栅未坚。\n营被数惊乘势破，将经频败遂生全。\n密招残寇防人觉，遥斩元凶恐自专。\n首让诸军无敢近，功归部曲不争先。\n开通州县斜连海，交割山河直到燕。\n战马散驱还逐草，肉牛齐散却耕田。\n府中独拜将军贵，门下兼分宰相权。\n唐史上头功第一，春风双节好朝天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}